Package: ecologytools
Title: Utilities and Data Visualization Tools for Ecology
Version: 1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ryan", "Martin", email = "ryanmartin@uidaho.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides custom functions, plotting utilities, and quantitative
    tools for ecological data analysis and visualization. Includes the
    theme_martin() ggplot2 theme for publication-style figures and the
    fresh() function for evaluating habitat-scale forage resources for
    generalist herbivores via linear programming.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.5.0)
